# The Fermentrack fixtures are byte-exact reproductions of Python `csv.writer`
# output, CRLF included. core.autocrlf would rewrite them on commit and the
# goldens would be checked out as a file Fermentrack could never have produced.
crates/fixtures/tests/fixtures/*.csv -text
# The brewd journal fixtures are LF by the same reasoning: `brewd` writes `\n`, and a
# checkout that turned it into `\r\n` would move every offset the tests assert.
crates/fixtures/tests/fixtures/journal/*.csv -text
